{
	"meta": {
		"title": "Pegasus Demo",
		"description": "Structured content for the plugin-showcase demo page (tpl_demo.php).",
		"github_org": "Visionquest-Development",
		"notes": [
			"Section `type` values: intro, child-themes, plugin.",
			"`hidden: true` hides a section EVERYWHERE — the demo showcase, its dot-nav entry, and the home-page plugin grid. Omit the property (or set it false) to show the section. Sections that were commented out in the original HTML are marked hidden here.",
			"Plugin sections carry `icon`, `blurb` and `accent` used by the home-page summary grid (tpl_home_pegasus.php). The demo page ignores these and cycles its own accent.",
			"`code.content` is stored DECODED (real < and > characters). When rendering inside <pre><code>, the template must run it through htmlspecialchars()/esc_html() so shortcodes and sample HTML display literally.",
			"`blocks` render in array order. Block `type` values: subheading, text, image, code.",
			"Image `container_class` preserves the original wrapper classes; `lightbox` true means wrap the <img> in an anchor with data-lightbox/data-title."
		]
	},
